      "learner_facing": true,
      "markdown": "## A — Delaware Class D authority and scope: Parking, speed restrictions and initial pedestrian duties\nIssuer: the Delaware Division of Motor Vehicles prepared the manual to help motorists handle Delaware roadways [A02].\nEdition: the front cover text reads July 2026 [A01].\nSelected path: the Class D Operator’s License includes passenger cars [A03].\nThe knowledge tests assess sign recognition and the state’s road rules, vehicle laws and safe-driving practices [A04].\nSelected topic: Parking, speed restrictions and initial pedestrian duties; instructional emphasis is authored coverage policy rather than a verified percentage of the exam.\nOfficial count, passing standard and time limit remain unknown (verify DE-PARKING-COUNT, DE-PARKING-PASS, DE-PARKING-TIME).\nRevision cadence and the graphical cover title/issuer remain separately recorded limitations (verify DE-PARKING-CADENCE, DE-PARKING-COVER).\nThe product’s practice mastery policy does not establish an official exam passing threshold.\n",
